#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:4
msgid "Deep-dive into the simulation launcher"
msgstr "深入了解仿真启动器"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:8
msgid ""
"Use :func:`app.add_launcher_args` and :func:`app.launch_simulation` to "
"configure a standalone script through command-line arguments and environment"
" variables. This example enables livestreaming and passes custom options to "
"the Isaac Sim runtime."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`app.add_launcher_args` 和 "
":func:`app.launch_simulation`，可通过命令行参数与环境变量配置独立脚本。本例启用直播，并向 Isaac Sim "
"运行时传入自定义选项。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:12
msgid ""
"Launching is split into two steps. First, :func:`app.add_launcher_args` "
"appends the launch-related options to the script's own "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`. Then, the :func:`app.launch_simulation` "
"context manager takes the simulation configuration and the parsed arguments,"
" and starts only the runtime that they need. The PhysX physics backend, Kit-"
"based RTX cameras, the Kit visualizer (``--visualizer kit``) and "
"livestreaming all run inside Isaac Sim (Kit), so for these "
":func:`~app.launch_simulation` starts a "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`. A kitless configuration, "
"for example Newton physics without a Kit visualizer, starts no Isaac Sim at "
"all. The runtime is closed automatically when the ``with`` block exits."
msgstr ""
"启动分为两步。首先，:func:`app.add_launcher_args` 向脚本自身的 "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 添加启动选项；随后，:func:`app.launch_simulation` "
"上下文管理器接收仿真配置与解析后的参数，仅启动所需运行时。PhysX 物理后端、基于 Kit 的 RTX 相机、Kit "
"可视化器（``--visualizer kit``）和直播都在 Isaac Sim（Kit）内运行，因此这些情况下 "
":func:`~app.launch_simulation` 会启动 "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`。不依赖 Kit 的配置，例如不使用 Kit 可视化器的 "
"Newton 物理仿真，则完全不启动 Isaac Sim。退出 ``with`` 块时，运行时自动关闭。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:21
msgid ""
"The launcher loads Isaac Sim extensions in the required order and applies "
"startup options such as ``headless`` before creating "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`. Its command-line options "
"can be combined with arguments defined by your script."
msgstr ""
"启动器按所需顺序加载 Isaac Sim 扩展，并在创建 :class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`"
" 前应用 ``headless`` 等启动选项。其命令行选项可与脚本自定义参数组合使用。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:26
msgid "The Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:28
msgid ""
"The tutorial corresponds to the ``launch_app.py`` script in the "
"``scripts/tutorials/00_sim`` directory."
msgstr "该教程对应于 ``scripts/tutorials/00_sim`` 目录中的 ``launch_app.py`` 脚本。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:0
msgid "Code for launch_app.py"
msgstr "launch_app.py 的代码"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:40
msgid "The Code Explained"
msgstr "代码解释"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:43
msgid "Adding arguments to the argparser"
msgstr "向 argparser 添加参数"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:45
msgid ""
"The launcher is designed to be compatible with custom CLI args that users "
"need for their own scripts, while still providing a portable CLI interface."
msgstr "启动器兼容用户脚本所需的自定义命令行参数，同时提供统一的命令行接口。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:48
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, a standard :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` is "
"instantiated and given the script-specific ``--size`` argument, as well as "
"the arguments ``--height`` and ``--width``. The latter are ingested by "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`."
msgstr ""
"在本教程中，实例化了一个标准的 :class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` ，并赋予了特定脚本的 ``--size`` "
"参数，以及参数 ``--height`` 和 ``--width`` 。后者被 "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 所列取。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:52
msgid ""
"The script handles ``--size`` itself. Add the launcher options to the same "
"parser with the :func:`~app.add_launcher_args` function, which appends the "
"launcher arguments to the given :class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser`. This can "
"then be processed into an :class:`argparse.Namespace` using the standard "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args` method."
msgstr ""
"脚本自行处理 ``--size``。通过 :func:`~app.add_launcher_args` 向同一个 "
":class:`~argparse.ArgumentParser` 解析器添加启动选项，再用标准的 "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.parse_args` 方法解析为 "
":class:`argparse.Namespace`。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:63
msgid "Launching the simulator"
msgstr "启动仿真器"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:65
msgid ""
"The parsed arguments are passed, together with the simulation configuration,"
" to :func:`~app.launch_simulation`. The configuration tells it which runtime"
" is needed (here, the default PhysX physics backend, which runs inside Isaac"
" Sim), and the arguments configure that runtime. Everything that uses the "
"simulator runs inside the ``with`` block."
msgstr ""
"已解析的参数与仿真配置一起传给 :func:`~app.launch_simulation` 。配置决定需要哪种运行时（这里是运行于 Isaac Sim"
" 中的默认 PhysX 物理后端），参数则配置该运行时。所有使用仿真器的代码均位于 ``with`` 块内。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:76
msgid "Understanding the output of --help"
msgstr "理解--help 的输出"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:78
msgid ""
"While executing the script, we can pass the ``--help`` argument and see the "
"combined outputs of the custom arguments and the launcher options "
"(abbreviated below)."
msgstr "执行脚本时，传入 ``--help`` 即可查看自定义参数和启动器选项的合并输出（下面有所省略）。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:119
msgid ""
"This readout details the ``--size``, ``--height``, and ``--width`` arguments"
" defined in the script directly, as well as the launcher arguments."
msgstr "该输出列出了脚本直接定义的 ``--size`` 、 ``--height`` 、 ``--width`` 参数，以及启动器参数。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:122
msgid ""
"Script arguments whose name and type match an argument of "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`, in this case ``--height`` "
"and ``--width``, are forwarded to the "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` instance when "
":func:`~app.launch_simulation` starts Isaac Sim. Please refer to the "
"`specification`_ for such arguments for more examples."
msgstr ""
"如果脚本参数的名称和类型与 :class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 的某个参数一致，这里的例子是"
" ``--height`` 和 ``--width`` ，那么 :func:`~app.launch_simulation` 启动 Isaac Sim "
"时，会将它们转交给 :class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 实例。更多示例见 `参数说明 "
"<specification_>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:128
msgid "Using environment variables"
msgstr "使用环境变量"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:130
msgid ""
"As noted in the help message, launcher arguments such as ``--livestream`` "
"have corresponding environment variables (envar) as well. These are detailed"
" in :mod:`isaaclab.app` documentation. Providing any of these arguments "
"through CLI is equivalent to running the script in a shell environment where"
" the corresponding envar is set."
msgstr ""
"如帮助信息所示， ``--livestream`` 等启动器参数也有对应的环境变量，详见 :mod:`isaaclab.app` "
"文档。通过命令行提供这些参数，等价于在已设置对应环境变量的 shell 中运行脚本。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:135
msgid ""
"The support for launcher envars is simply a convenience to provide session-"
"persistent configurations, and can be set in the user's ``${HOME}/.bashrc`` "
"for persistent settings between sessions. In the case where these arguments "
"are provided from the CLI, they will override their corresponding envar, as "
"we will demonstrate later in this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"启动器支持环境变量，是为了方便保留会话中的配置。可以将其写入用户的 ``${HOME}/.bashrc`` "
"，使设置在不同会话间持续生效。如果同时通过命令行提供参数，则命令行值会覆盖对应环境变量；本教程稍后会演示这一点。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:140
msgid ""
"These arguments can be used with any script that starts the simulation using"
" :func:`~app.launch_simulation`. Camera and offscreen rendering support is "
"configured automatically."
msgstr "任何使用 :func:`~app.launch_simulation` 启动仿真的脚本都能使用这些参数。相机和离屏渲染支持会自动配置。"

